provenance.sourcePrompt:
Award slab — verified awards text over dark background. No red carpet, no ceremony hall, no generated face. 6s, 1920x1080, SILENT. Two-column layout: large role name left, verified award proof right separated by red rule
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,900;1,400&family=Inter:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
root{--bg:#090a0d;--paper:#f3eee5;--muted:#a6a19a;--red:#d72f2f;--gold:#c6a46a;}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
body,#scene{width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg);}
#scene{position:relative;}
#bg{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;z-index:1;opacity:0.22;filter:grayscale(70%) brightness(0.4);}
#vig{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;z-index:2;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,transparent 30%,rgba(9,10,13,0.88) 100%);}
award-slab{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:10;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.45fr .55fr;align-items:center;padding:110px 120px;}
award-role{max-width:980px;font:400 96px/.92 'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.045em;color:var(--paper);opacity:0;}
award-proof{padding-left:32px;border-left:3px solid var(--red);opacity:0;}
award-year{color:var(--gold);font:400 68px/1 'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;}
award-name{margin-top:10px;font:700 22px/1.25 'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--paper);}
award-source{margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font:600 14px/1.5 'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="scene">
<video id="bg" autoplay muted loop playsinline><source src="{{bgVid}}" type="video/mp4"></video>
<div id="vig"></div>
<div class="award-slab">
<div class="award-role" id="role">The<br>Imitation<br>Game</div>
<div class="award-proof" id="proof">
<div class="award-year">2015</div>
<div class="award-name">Oscar Nomination<br>Best Actor</div>
<div class="award-source">Academy of Motion Picture<br>Arts and Sciences</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<script src="vendor/gsap.min.js"></script>
<script>
window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',function(){
var tl=gsap.timeline()
tl.to('#role', {opacity:1,x:0,duration:0.65,ease:'power3.out',startAt:{opacity:0,x:-20}},0.35)
tl.to('#proof',{opacity:1,x:0,duration:0.65,ease:'power3.out',startAt:{opacity:0,x:16}},0.7)
tl.to('.award-slab',{opacity:0,duration:0.5,ease:'power2.in'},5.3)
})
</script>
</body>
</html>
```
